<title>JAPAN: Nagano Bank to list shares on TSE second section.</title>
<headline>Nagano Bank to list shares on TSE second section.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tokyo Stock Exchange (TSE) said on Friday that Nagano Bank Ltd has applied to list its shares on the second section of the bourse.</p>
<p>Trading of the shares is expected to start on March 12, the TSE said in a statement.</p>
<p>The bank plans to issue 10 million new shares to the public. Subscription is scheduled for March 5 and 6.</p>
<p>The regional bank is based in Nagano prefecture in northern Japan.</p>
